Source: xdg-desktop-portal-regolith
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ken Gilmer <kgilmer@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10),
               meson
Standards-Version: 4.1.2
Homepage: https://github.com/regolith-linux/xdg-desktop-portal-regolith

Package: xdg-desktop-portal-regolith
Architecture: all
Section: oldlibs
Depends:
  ${misc:Depends}
Description: transitional package for the retired Regolith portal backend
 The Regolith XDG portal backend is retired. Regolith uses the GTK, wlroots
 and GNOME portal backends, as configured by
 xdg-desktop-portal-regolith-x11-config and
 xdg-desktop-portal-regolith-wayland-config. Upgrading to this empty package
 removes the old backend. It can be removed safely.

Package: xdg-desktop-portal-regolith-x11-config
Architecture: any
Depends:
  xdg-desktop-portal (>=1.20),
  ${regolith:X11ConfigDepends}
Description: Regolith X11 XDG Portal configuration file

Package: xdg-desktop-portal-regolith-wayland-config
Architecture: any
Depends:
  xdg-desktop-portal (>=1.20)
Description: Regolith Wayland XDG Portal configuration file
